        "fontFamily": "Open Sans, sans-serif",
        "fontWeight": 400,
        "textDecoration": "none"
      },
      "value": "The student has been under my care for a mild viral infection from March 14, 2024 to March 18, 2024. Based on the medical \nevaluation, the student:",
      "autoScale": false
    },
