        "fontStyle": "normal",
        "textAlign": "left",
        "fontFamily": "Open Sans, sans-serif",
        "fontWeight": 400,
        "textDecoration": "none"
      },
      "value": "- Has fully recovered and is now fit to resume regular school activities.\n- Is cleared for school attendance from March 19, 2024.\n- Should avoid any strenuous physical activities until March \n25,2024.",
